      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<div><strong>SAMPLE TYPE: </strong>EDTA Blood</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>METHOD: </strong>Real Time - PCR</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<table style=\"width: 73.4672%; height: 141.4px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 37.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 69.535%;\"><strong>GENE VARIANT</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 30.4216%;\"><strong>RESULTS</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 42px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 69.535%;\">FLT3 gene mutation [FLT3-ITD]</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 30.4216%;\"><strong>NOT-DETECTED</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 69.535%;\">FLT3 gene mutation [FLT3-TKD (D835)]</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 30.4216%;\"><strong>NOT-DETECTED</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>PROGNOSIS:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>FLT3-ITD is associated with high blast counts, increased risk of relapse and decreased survival. Normal karyotype and absence of FLT3-ITD mutations have favorable prognosis. FLT3-TKD &nbsp;have worse outcome.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>LIMITATIONS:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>For&nbsp;FLT3-ITD and D835 mutations, the LOD is equal to 2% mutant allele in background of 98% wild type allele.</li>\n<li>This assay detects only the above mentioned mutations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
      "_id": "678b6e4d00b1e4b2833f6ee9"
    }
